          // first/last button - the moment that button was selected, hovered, pressed,
          // focus-visible or disabled (confirmed in a real browser: reproduced this root's exact
          // box-shadow/children relationship in isolation and watched the ring vanish along the
          // covered edges in each of those states, then confirmed outline fixes it). outline
