          // .tecton-buttongroup-outlined wrapper already uses for this exact "stroke with no
          // layout space, must not be box-shadow" case (PrimeNG package's own
          // components/buttons.ts - its own comment there tried box-shadow:inset first and
          // rejected it too, though for a different reason: the render-parity comparator
          // confusing it with Figma's own box-shadow property).
